{
  "$comment": "One hand-written description of what a canvas may offer. tests/test_node_spec.py holds schema.py and all three canvases to it: the point is to fail loudly on the next drift, not to generate the UIs. `tip` (and each `tips` extra) is the canvas tooltip key (TIPS[...]) that must exist in dashboard/dist/index.js, desktop/plugin.js and widgets/designer.html; `required` mirrors schema.REQUIRED_FIELDS. A field with `derives` is a canvas-only control: its name must never reach the backend, and every name it derives must be one the backend reads. Fields the validator accepts but no canvas edits (agent `schema`/`inputs`/`timeout`) are deliberately absent.",
